<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', 'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif", padding: 0 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Paper2Video 项目汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8FB6E8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>复盘</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '24px 40px', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 34, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 2 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>三件事分开说</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8', marginLeft: 6 }}>哪是我的功劳，哪是运气，哪是我记错了</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 492, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 380, height: 492, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '30px 26px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', letterSpacing: 3 }}>复盘</Text>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>01</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>做对的</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#8B97A8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>02</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>靠运气的</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#D9534F', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>03</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>记错的</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>这一页按这三类划分。把不属于自己的功劳认领了，比说错一个数更麻烦。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 796, height: 492, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>把一条判据留下来了</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>"退出码 0 不等于内容正确"——凡是要调外部工具的环节，都在结果侧再取一次样。改过的地方也都配了自检脚本，环境重装之后一条命令就能验回来。</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '4px solid #8B97A8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>换 API 那一步几乎没改代码，这是运气</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>上游那个取模型配置的函数本来就写了兜底分支，换模型只要传个参数。省下来的工作量不是我做出来的，我把这一点写进了文档，免得被当成工作量。</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FCEBEB', border: '1px solid #F7C1C1', borderLeft: '4px solid #D9534F', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#A32D2D' }}>两个错误在笔记里记了很久</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>一个是"上游代码被忽略、不要改"，实际它一直在版本控制里——照这个理解我会白白重打一遍补丁。另一个是数字人的型号：两份文档写的不是同一个，而代码里的默认值是第三个。两处都是翻代码才发现的。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 48, padding: '0 40px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>已按核实结果修正两处记录，并同步到文档与项目笔记</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>14 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
